<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Hicor cautions shareholders.</title>
<headline>Hicor cautions shareholders.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hicor Ltd on Tuesday warned shareholders that negotiations were taking place which could affect the group's share price.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
